flowchart TB
    %% CoreBase SpecHarness Context Stack — implementation authority:
    %% ARCHITECTURE.md §3.2, context_engine.py, context-routes.yaml, harness-config.yaml
    %% Palette: documents/diagrams/source/_shared/palette.md

    DEV["Developer / repository owner<br/>requests outcomes and confirms decisions"]:::actor
    AGENT["Coding agent<br/>selects a direct skill and executes its procedure"]:::agent
    REPO[("Adopter repository<br/>source · artifacts · configuration · memory")]:::repository

    DEV -->|request / review / approval| AGENT
    AGENT -->|bounded reads and focused writes| REPO

    T1["Layer 1 — Portable Entrypoint<br/>AGENTS.md · skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md<br/><em>Operating contract and selected procedure</em>"]:::t1
    T2["Layer 2 — Mandatory Bootstrap<br/>corebase-specharness/rules/caveman.md<br/>corebase-specharness/memories/repo/core-policies.md sections<br/><em>Must sources</em>"]:::t2
    T3["Layer 3 — Named Route Sources<br/>references/context-routes.yaml<br/>project files · rules · durable memory · domain packs<br/><em>Must / Should files and H2 sections</em>"]:::t3
    T4["Layer 4 — Feature and Session Evidence<br/>artifacts/features/&lt;slug&gt;/ route-declared files<br/>.corezero/sessions/&lt;slug&gt;/session.md · active T-NNN excerpt<br/>session.md last_context_fingerprint + last_context_slices<br/>auto-delta skips unchanged files and H2 sections unless --full<br/>--full after compact or new chat on the same feature<br/><em>Loaded when the named route and feature require it</em>"]:::t4
    T5["Layer 5 — Retrieved Repository Evidence<br/>bounded matching excerpts from configured roots<br/><em>Intent + feature + task; exclusions and size limits applied</em>"]:::t5
    T6["Layer 6 — Transient Tool Evidence<br/>command output · tests · provider results · subagent summaries<br/>corebase-specharness/generated/{gate,provider,verification}-runs.json<br/><em>Summarize into proof or handoff; do not bulk-inject</em>"]:::t6

    T1 -->|route selected by --skill| T2
    T2 -->|add route-declared sources| T3
    T3 -->|add active feature evidence| T4
    T4 -->|retrieve bounded local matches| T5
    T5 -->|run proof and diagnostics| T6

    AGENT -->|skill-enter / context-load / context-explain| T1
    T3 -->|reads adopter-owned knowledge| REPO
    T4 -->|reads and writes lifecycle evidence| REPO
    T5 -->|reads matching source excerpts| REPO
    T6 -->|records task proof, review, or run history| REPO

    T6 -.->|checkpoint decisions and next action| T4
    T4 -.->|candidate reusable lessons| T3

    LOAD["Load rules:<br/>context-routes.yaml is the only routing authority<br/>Must sources survive budget pressure; Should sources may be omitted<br/>session auto-delta runs before budget and skips unchanged files/H2s<br/>--full after conversation compact or new chat; session-end does not clear hashes<br/>context-explain reports provenance, trust, token use, and omission reasons"]:::note

